      "id": "n1",
      "title": "Suzuka delivers a classic as the title fight tightens",
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "author": "Race Control",
      "tag": "Race report",
      "pinned": false,
      "image": "",
      "body": "Round 4 at Suzuka had everything — a wet start, a strategy gamble on lap 18 and a final-sector battle through the Esses.\n\n## Key moments\n- A brilliant opening lap from the front row set the tone\n- Two cars tangled at the hairpin, bringing out the VSC\n- The fastest lap went down to the final ten laps\n\nNext up: **Miami**, our second sprint weekend of the season."
    },
    {
